{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","索恩"],["/names/en","Soren"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名沉默而又勇武的游侠，擅长利用地形来克制敌人。"],["/description_i18n/en","A silent yet fierce Rogue, adept at using terrain to outmatch enemies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嗯，我来。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","I've arrived."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好……有进步。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Alright! There's progress."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","这里是……我的战场！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","This is my battlefield!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","……不行，不能输……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I... can't lose... Ah..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","嗯，又赢了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Mm. Another victory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","去追逐胜利吧，因为胜利就在前方。"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","Let's pursue that victory! It's just up ahead."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","嗯？什么人？"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hm? Who's there!?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","这几天老实巡逻都好几天没战斗了，走吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Huh, I've been patrolling for days... There's been no action lately. Hm, let's go!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","我一定。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Mm? ...Yes! I'll surely..."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","非常感谢，我会珍惜的。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","Many thanks... I'll cherish this dearly."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","……送给我？谢谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","...For me? Thank you."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","默行战意"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Silent Fury"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","沉默而勇武，战斗是最好的语言。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","For those who march forward in quiet resolve, battle speaks in their stead."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","残阳金晖"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Golden Afterglow"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","日落前最后一道夕阳，看上去会格外耀眼。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","The final ray of sunlight before sunset is always the most dazzling."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","烈阳演武活动限时礼包购买获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Sunlit Showdown Limited Bundle"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","史诗"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Epic"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","休息一下吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Take a break."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","这根棍子很趁手"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","This is one fine stick."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","肉。面包。清水。谢谢"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Meat, bread, and water. Thanks."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪……第一次见"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's my first time seeing snow..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","和大家一起过节吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Let's celebrate together, everyone."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","……乌尔氏族的孩子会喜欢吗"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Will the Uru Clan kids like this dish?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要去看灯吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Care to come see the lights?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","索恩不太擅长处理头发，现在的发型是阿尔萨帮忙打理的。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Soren isn't very skilled at managing his own hair, so Alsa volunteers as his stylist."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","索恩是个战斗天才，无论哪种武器，索恩都得心应手——事实上，连弓箭他都用得不错。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Soren is a prodigy of combat. He excels with any weapon and even handles a bow and arrow quite well."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","在经历过一次饥荒后，索恩经常主动盘点存粮。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Having once experienced a famine, Soren regularly takes the initiative to check food reserves."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","乌尔氏族曾经有好事者统计过，在没有人主动搭话的情况下，索恩居然整整三天一言不发。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","Someone from the Uru Clan once counted that, without anyone initiating conversation, Soren remained completely silent for three whole days."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","索恩的个性和大部分蛮血类似，直来直往，听不太懂潜台词，也不太会说漂亮话。事实上，普通的话他也不太说——比起语言，索恩更喜欢行动。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","Soren is similar to most Maulers. He's straightforward, doesn't get subtleties, and hates flowery words. In fact, he's quiet in general, preferring action over talk."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","据说索恩选择木棍的首要原因是因为便宜又好更换，而且唾手可得。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","It's rumored that Soren's main reason for choosing a wooden stick is because it's cheap, easy to replace, and easy to obtain."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","和大多数被抛弃的孩子不同，索恩知晓自己的父母和出身的氏族——但他从未想过回头。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Unlike most abandoned children, Soren knows his parents and the clan he comes from—but he's never once thought of returning."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","别再说索恩不爱搭理人了，要注意观察他的耳朵，通常来说，抖动一下是“我听到了”，两下是“什么事”。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Can't say Soren doesn't like to talk to people anymore. Pay attention to his ears... usually, one shake means \"I heard you,\" and two shakes mean \"Huh?\""],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","索恩其实很喜欢蜂蜜，但因为某些原因，他从来不愿意承认这一点。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","Soren actually really likes honey, but for some reason, he never wants to admit it."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","索恩脚力非常好，曾经阿尔萨和他比赛谁先从山顶跑到山脚下；结果还是索恩赢了——阿尔萨中途就团成了球！"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","Soren is extremely nimble. He and Alsa once raced to the foot of a mountain from the top. Soren won, even with Alsa curling into a ball halfway through!"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，最开始见到阿尔萨时，我吓了一跳呢！就看到一个球形从远方向我们滚来……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Honestly, when I first laid eyes on Alsa rolling towards us from a distance, I was scared..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411010.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 满满 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Chippy & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","好了吗？烤肉好了吗？"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","How's the meat coming along? Is it ready yet?"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411020.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","满满 & 索恩 & 阿尔萨"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Chippy & Soren & Alsa"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","如果可以选降生地的话，谁会选在这光秃秃的沙海呢？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Who'd choose to be born in this barren desert if they had a choice?"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411030.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/2/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","不知道索恩有没有这种感觉，残阳武斗场跟我想象中的不太一样。"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Soren, I'm not sure how you're feeling, but this Sunseek Arena is nothing like what I imagined."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411040.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 索恩 & 曼卡拉"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Soren & Mikola"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/3/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","你们感受到了吗？刚才刮过来一阵清凉的风。"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Did you feel it? A refreshing breeze."],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411100.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411100.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","漫漫 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Hammie & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/4/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","你们能这样快适应沙漠，我很意外。"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","You guys adapted to this desert very quickly."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411120.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411120.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","索恩"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Soren"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/5/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","好好休息，我可以守夜。"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Get some rest. I'll keep watch."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411150.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411150.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","沙奎尔 & 阿尔萨 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Shakir & Alsa & Soren"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/6/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Ashen Wastes"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","你问战歌节胜者的名号？"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","The winner of the Warsong Festival?"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412020.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412020.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","索恩 & 瓦尔克"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Soren & Walker"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/7/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","赏金猎人这行，有个笑话。"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","There's a popular joke among bounty hunters."],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412050.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412050.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","瓦尔克 & 满满 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Walker & Chippy & Soren"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/8/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","我的过去……你会对这些感兴趣吗？<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>？"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","My past... Are you really interested, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412080.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412080.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Antandra & Soren"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，你们在炖什么！好香啊！"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Hey! What's for dinner? It smells so good!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412090.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412090.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","诡草 & 索恩"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Rhys & Soren"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Eroded Enclave"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/1/name_i18n/cn","深红高原"],["/interaction_records/10/locations/1/name_i18n/en","Crimson Highlands"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","索恩，坐下好好休息吧，已经走了一天，应该很疲劳了。"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Soren, take a seat. You've walked all day. Your body needs some rest."],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11412120.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","安丹德拉 & 索恩 & 萨忒娜"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Antandra & Soren & Satrana"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","风蚀飞地"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/